{
    ApplicationLicenseKey = "your_license_key",
    LiveApiKey = "your_live_api_key",
    SandboxApiKey = "your_sandbox_api_key"
};
```

### Summary
While Visual Studio doesn't directly offer a feature to auto-generate property assignments in the editor for each instance, you can streamline the instantiation process with constructors, factory methods, or using records. Consider exploring extensions or code generation tools if this is a frequent task in your workflow.

